                  <nc xml:id="m-9037c98b-9e94-438c-a028-6f5f5d919b3b" pname="g" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-211a51d0-1a85-4b69-9aeb-6c327c6a04f8" form="v" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-28917b4e-b55b-4837-9779-2ec875715663"><lg xml:id="m-ecc0a35b-8c17-4082-9128-ce7c6878c696"><l xml:id="m-d40c72bb-5768-42dd-8182-1af9c84bcb0f" facs="#m-134406d5-d02c-4e53-809e-18fdd1cf0d36" label="ambiguous">1403</l><l xml:id="m-e84203a4-0bd1-4e5b-8065-fcec289a80cc" facs="#m-a081b0a6-17ce-4d27-b0c6-e50aabf9a521" label="ambiguous">May 7. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-1c2a1b1e-fae9-4adb-8994-264c72e12d16" facs="#m-801e64bb-e46f-4b3c-b9fd-154134c81ee8" label="text-like">Mass. Protexisti. p. 1146, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-4c1f1921-9eba-4dbf-9d97-032333c2c78c" facs="#m-623b2169-0b0d-426c-9ed9-b5dfe1b6cb44" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-9cd3a505-3ded-43dc-9f15-ea63f66b57a8" facs="#m-55a7d51a-781e-40d4-a173-72b2e406dab2" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui cónspicis quia nos ún-l nis Apóstoli tui et Evangelistae</l><l xml:id="m-aca01919-1208-41f2-ba67-cb1d26c67c2f" facs="#m-66811a09-545f-41b3-8ef5-60365017f6e6" label="lyrics-like">Ddique mala nostra pertúrbant:tl intercéssio gloriósa nos prótegat.</l><l xml:id="m-093ac104-c115-4fc5-8326-239439bddc06" facs="#m-acab27ad-bf0c-4194-a0b2-fdbd890c7490" label="lyrics-like">praesta, quaésumus;*ut beáti Joán-] Per Dõminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5599f247-0d37-48fd-8223-363f7a55d85f" facs="#m-bbbffb19-a90a-424c-b597-ed4c17661bb8" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1207.</l><l xml:id="m-b3d193ee-5e27-4ec1-9b2a-593b5bd04868" facs="#m-b95b66f9-c917-4a0c-bddb-5b0c7d946d35" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia. Y. Jústus germinábit. p. 1192.</l><l xml:id="m-cf172336-e2d8-46db-966d-6d0231f01ed6" facs="#m-bedc439d-bd27-4e49-8865-18fdd68bbd23" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 20. c.</l><l xml:id="m-e3b621db-63dc-4fb9-b95a-43cbbf17a4b8" facs="#m-748847c3-e170-4736-86a1-5ac2e38acbb4" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore:Accéssit ad Jesum] petátis. Potéstis bibere cálicem,</l><l xml:id="m-ab6d10cf-16ce-4b98-ad4d-b854ee32dd99" facs="#m-5ad01782-0d6b-4c82-b62d-ae04739bc611" label="lyrics-like">L mater filiórum Zebedaéi cum [quem ego bibitúrus sum? Dicunt</l><l xml:id="m-2caefa94-f8cd-4f8d-bd56-32848481e82c" facs="#m-561bca70-e09c-48d5-946a-560fd3173439" label="lyrics-like">ei : Póssumus. Ait illis: Cálicem</l><l xml:id="m-804fdd9b-d6ee-4b91-beb4-1d56f8c00c05" facs="#m-40bc26bf-4318-4d33-94a0-c2b8eec708b2" label="lyrics-like">filiis suis, adórans, et petens áliquid</l><l xml:id="m-0cfb6cbf-22fd-4aac-9de3-36b3db8f7f6e" facs="#m-00569a59-343d-4706-aaca-ad284048e763" label="lyrics-like">quidem meum bibétis: sedére autem</l><l xml:id="m-bfdf810c-9c75-4dee-8dcf-02988d6fc291" facs="#m-2185918f-e272-4f6d-ba1c-b54cde9a19c2" label="ambiguous">ab eo. Qui dixit ei: Quid vis? Ait</l><l xml:id="m-6377548d-6b21-49e1-af57-450af9400bc0" facs="#m-b270a4e9-1a53-4e57-98cc-8143225c0599" label="lyrics-like">ili: Dic, ut sédeant hi duo filii mei,</l><l xml:id="m-07583c58-daf6-4533-9e09-80ad408f24d8" facs="#m-f4edbc55-a91c-4dec-9f7f-c3bcb53fb82d" label="lyrics-like">ad déxteram meam vel sinistram,</l><l xml:id="m-9849390f-bf94-44ae-8afc-5a898ff069bd" facs="#m-f935bc91-cf5e-41b2-b99a-796e757b4b0d" label="ambiguous">non est meum dare vobis, sed quibus</l><l xml:id="m-8ec167c3-028c-4b9c-b1be-a4ca7b47c7bb" facs="#m-1d6875b3-eac8-45f7-ae1d-9e0ac221d272" label="lyrics-like">unus ad déxteram tuam, et unus ad</l><l xml:id="m-297aec49-309b-41f8-94be-070c5bf47b82" facs="#m-13055b8c-9451-4cd6-ac6f-171324077f30" label="lyrics-like">sinistram in regno tuo. Respóndens ] parátum est a Patre meo. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-fa9c7598-7501-4f5e-b07e-0173668bc11b" facs="#m-3efd054c-a453-4134-81fc-a905eb15f56a" label="ambiguous">autem Jesus, dixit: Nescitis quid</l><l xml:id="m-a457d13a-e749-4bbe-84c7-fa80285784be" facs="#m-d3be9f1d-cc33-424a-b3f5-e0ddc1c9c180" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Munéribus nóstris. p. 1138.</l><l xml:id="m-bb0386c3-3a45-40e5-aab6-dd1d85b21452" facs="#m-4cca6966-7f61-4474-bff5-529e5d5192d2" label="text-like">Preface of the Apostles, p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-0be5ef21-4d62-4b42-88d2-9f114ab6bc64" facs="#m-82ca4005-46a5-4eec-b473-77a05a4f671e" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ceb33df5-6f19-49e2-973c-37d00d0c63be" facs="#m-876d1fcd-82a6-47bf-b298-35dd52ca7872" label="lyrics-like">DEfécti, Dómine, pane caelésti: mur aetérnam. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-c31dc2f9-622a-45e7-8ad0-48721af19666" facs="#m-a8498c78-bea2-413e-a1f1-afccd1de9135" label="lyrics-like">L ad vitam, quaésumus, nutriá-l strum.</l><l xml:id="m-1fc92a8d-d003-4ea5-994a-c52b81559bc0" facs="#m-7b3ea3df-57f7-4f5a-85eb-a1f48f064017" label="text-like">St. Stanislaus, Bishop and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-14234f47-66d0-4a3e-acd8-d5e2adb325bd" facs="#m-155e5c4c-b81e-4a62-bb13-251440d5353e" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-3798ff02-3f0e-4f1a-ad57-42218ea6d786" facs="#m-05ebd5d1-7434-4445-83fd-b7987e7b76e1" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-5293c234-6d88-42db-ad46-4ef25df0a138" facs="#m-2e2f82d8-0518-49c9-9928-59e4ed39663e" label="text-like">Mass. Protexisti. 1146, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-6e966746-a754-4a1e-b375-76f45e551a0b" facs="#m-905b3921-3b52-4baa-9ce9-c5297d70bdeb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-59edf34d-b1b0-4d07-bef8-2f84ac7fdeeb" facs="#m-761df78e-75c0-4527-b6da-d34f8fa5a67a" label="lyrics-like">Eus, pro cujus honôre gloriósus! sumus; ut omnes qui ejus implórant</l><l xml:id="m-a9cd4368-733e-47e7-9335-9fa2f5f766bb" facs="#m-f0dccca5-bf8e-4a1b-ac72-cead00da886e" label="lyrics-like">1 Póntifex Stanisláus glãdiis im-l auxilium, “ petitiónis suae salutárem</l><l xml:id="m-5b68d048-713e-42c8-bbc0-148c9cf8ef6d" facs="#m-ba37ddd4-acf8-4a7f-8e10-7b07b3d82684" label="lyrics-like">piórum occúbuit : t praesta, quaé¬ consequántur efféctum. Per Dñum</l><l xml:id="m-18313d35-9920-430c-a136-0ca78c77bbf1" facs="#m-841c8af5-a9f5-4047-ba57-e3015b882751" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Múnera tibi. and Postcommunion. Haec nos comménio. p. 1185.</l><l xml:id="m-0b14c002-1f7d-4466-9d42-0ab5bde4848c" facs="#m-87be04ea-a5b3-4406-b818-e51e664bcfb6" label="text-like">8. The Apparition of St. Michael, the Archangel.</l><l xml:id="m-f1b9ccdc-049b-4850-82ed-4e3873a4250f" facs="#m-cad40fef-2833-4487-9ee0-f4595c29ade6" label="ambiguous">Double major.</l><l xml:id="m-919fa601-c1ba-481f-863c-14308575dee0" facs="#m-070371cb-664a-4019-8867-c88955cf2608" label="text-like">All as on the Feast of September 29. p. 1652. In Paschal Time. Alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-459868b6-f8cb-4e13-97b9-4046eb40db03" facs="#m-6093b52d-4b29-4828-a2ba-28d9fe94d9a0" label="text-like">is added wherever necessary in accordance with the rubrics, and the Hymn</l><l xml:id="m-ee653d84-3a77-4a96-926a-083cb6fdc5eb" facs="#m-f4778435-c707-4bf8-9e01-f4191a6412cc" label="text-like">is sung as follows:</l><l xml:id="m-4145b934-3db9-4c44-8ec9-f0f51ce0c2c4" facs="#m-a5d57eea-bfb1-4115-81be-402e2f64d58d" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-b93464be-1998-481a-8cba-7e91617d57b8" facs="#m-3c21c725-6bc7-4ad0-8e91-9972590dd346" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-a012a972-ee01-4716-8f9c-f4ee30200f68" facs="#m-50587f5f-4544-430e-bfae-bb19d56e0dfe" label="lyrics-like">E spléndor et virtus Pátris, Te ví-ta, Jésu, cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe7d73d4-0716-47a6-8a8a-ce2e20d9a548" facs="#m-c0a2023b-bc50-4e93-b1c9-7b5cad84ffc1" label="lyrics-like">péndent tú-o, Laudámus inter An¬</l><l xml:id="m-e61b8480-6c3a-4cf9-aa86-1e490c9ad4fd" facs="#m-4ebbea1b-2de5-43b4-a039-885d91f0b36c" label="lyrics-like">di-um, Ab óre qui</l><l xml:id="m-a5fc2600-e17d-45cf-a9a6-b6ae603d1b46" facs="#m-a3576628-6c33-475d-815e-194c1c43d7cf" label="ambiguous">N° 801. — 88</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>